 What is Recursion?
 ->  Recursion is a method of solving c computational problem where
    the solution depends on solutions to smaller instances of the same problem.

 Base case -> imp to know
 we travel in two directions
 - top to down (towards the base case)
 - down to top (from the base case)

 1. base case define
 2. current function (work)
 3. inner fun call

 Call Stack

