 printDec n=5   5
 printDec n=6   6
 printDec n=7   7
 printDec n=8   8
 printDec n=9   9
 printDec n=10  10
 main n=10


 first towards the base case in call stack
 then comes down while we print the numbers

 stack overflow
    1. parameter more
    2. too many calls